  https://github.com/VatsalP117/build-interactive-study-guides # Transcript + spreadsheet screenshots → offline HTML guide. Marks inferred steps.

  https://github.com/kangarooking/cangjie-skill # Kreil’s formulas and procedures → reusable agent skills. Tests when each method applies.

