  04–08  |  TAKE NOTES AND REVIEW ACROSS LECTURES
  -----------------------------------------------

  https://github.com/SYuan03/Skill-Anything # Quizzes every section of a long lecture. Exports Anki cards with exact source quotes.

  https://github.com/OnePathToFreedom/smart-notes-skill # Recurring indicators merge into one Obsidian note. Flashcards test links across lectures.

  https://github.com/baney75/myelinate # Recall before recap. Timestamped questions point straight to the clip worth replaying.

  https://github.com/anatoledms/lecture-transcript-to-notes # Captions → Markdown walkthrough. Flags missing demo steps and verifies references.

