  09–12  |  QUESTION THE MATERIAL AND TEST YOUR UNDERSTANDING
  ----------------------------------------------------------

  https://github.com/HKUDS/DeepTutor # Course-wide Q&A with page citations. Graded Mastery Path questions feed a reusable question bank.

  https://github.com/janestreet/agent_skills/ # Jane Street Socratic oral exam. One question at a time, 0–5 mastery map per subskill.

